      <h4>Target UK→Global Apple Arbitrage</h4>
      <p>The UK offers Apple watches at a median $392.74 — a 28.6% discount to the global Apple median of $550. Source Apple inventory from UK-based casual sellers (who dominate at 214 listings) and resell into Australia ($792 median) or Japan ($688 median). This represents a potential 75–100% markup channel.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">2</div>
      <h4>Source Garmin in Japan, Sell to UK/North America</h4>
      <p>Japan has the lowest Garmin prices ($506 median) with 87.5% of sellers offering worldwide shipping. Resell into Canada ($890 median) or the UK ($775 median) for 53–76% upside. Prioritize 47mm+ Garmin models — they command an additional 18–25% premium over smaller sizes.</p>
    </div>

