      <p>The top 87 sellers control 48.2% of all listings and hold 82% of all Garmin inventory. Their 46.7% worldwide shipping rate makes them logistics-ready partners. A supply agreement with 3–5 top Garmin-focused sellers (e.g., Seller_0042 with 196 listings, Seller_0033 with 175) could anchor a Garmin resale business.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">4</div>
      <h4>Avoid Used Samsung Inventory</h4>
      <p>Samsung's 18.2% new-to-used premium gap is the widest in the market. Used Samsung watches sell at a significant discount ($540 mean vs $639 new) while new-in-box units command near-retail prices. Only source Samsung in new or open-box condition; liquidate used Samsung inventory quickly to avoid margin compression.</p>
