      <p>1,513 casual sellers (single-listing) are 83.3% Apple-focused and price $79 below the power-seller median. Domestic marketplaces in the US (1,831 Apple listings) provide the deepest pool. Implement a systematic outreach program to convert one-time casual sellers into recurring supply — they represent the most underpriced inventory in the market.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rec-card">
      <div class="rec-num">6</div>
